				'FPGA Implementation of In-Cycle Closed-Loop Combustion Control Methods · SAE Technical Paper Series · 2021',
				'Indicated efficiency optimization by in-cycle closed-loop combustion control of diesel engines · Control Engineering Practice · 2022',
